{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/LibraryHeaderCpasule_920x430_.png?t=1744389451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exhilarating adventure with Pudding the Frog in this challenging physics-based precision platformer! In <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>, you'll need to master the art of jumping and grappling as you help Pudding reclaim her stolen pudding from the mischievous Harry the Heron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through multiple unique biomes with obstacles and hazards, testing your skills and reflexes at every turn. Can you guide Pudding to victory and retrieve her beloved dessert? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/Struggle1.gif?t=1744389451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Experience tight, responsive controls that make every jump and grapple feel satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Stakes</strong>: Feel the pressure as you climb through the world; one mistake could cost you all your progress! Learn from your mistakes and come back more prepared for your next attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Colorful Cast of Characters</strong>: Follow Pudding's journey as she meets strange animals she would never have met by her pond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Physics Based-Grapple</strong>: Utilize Pudding's grappling hook to build tremendous speed and find your own solution to each difficult platforming challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558570/extras/Slim.png?t=1744389451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute and Playful</strong>: Tired of being a bald man in your &quot;Rage Games?&quot; Pudding frog offers a cute and colorful aesthetic to help offset that frustration you are feeling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: We promise you won't get sick of hearing the music after countless hours of falling...no way that happens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun 2D Assets</strong>: Painstakingly drawn  by mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smaller Than Life:\u00a0</strong> You are just a little frog in a great big world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Pudding on her quest and prove your mental fortitude in <strong>Pudding Frog</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pudding Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/52cc25623fb1391dbc89583e43a31a5cda25a6f3.jpg"},{"name":"Pudding Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/a900f5673cff489178a0bbb434c0688cbd646ad6.jpg"},{"name":"Pudding Aficionado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/dbd1b238dd83d7a2eb9cd385f8503259dd84dae7.jpg"},{"name":"Talkative","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/f5575936d262e9812f6a38e44da3bb73d0f31790.jpg"},{"name":"What A View","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/72c7d49c708b66e55c03bf0aceee25d6ca23ac78.jpg"},{"name":"Mine Over Matter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/134216c11bc9e396ef1e9767af3e8bf883d44eaa.jpg"},{"name":"Smooth Is Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3558570/6ea92454972eecbe4f4b45d